      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reyno%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally called Needmore, the town moved 1½ miles north in 1901 to sit beside the new St. Louis–San Francisco Railway.",
